WEBVTT

00:20.880 --> 00:26.860
If I was dreaming, how did I forget?

00:26.920 --> 00:30.690
It pulsed through me, frigid, shocked me

00:30.690 --> 00:32.330
Can I do, do?

00:33.000 --> 00:38.000
I want you next to me when I summon you

00:39.170 --> 00:43.000
Waiting close by, but you seem far off

00:43.010 --> 00:45.340
Na, na, na, knight

00:45.340 --> 00:48.510
The more beautiful the rose

00:48.510 --> 00:51.480
The more its thorns hurt

00:51.480 --> 00:54.750
Now that I'm strong

00:54.750 --> 00:59.750
My heart knows to protect that vow

01:00.760 --> 01:03.790
Let's meet in the dark of night

01:03.790 --> 01:06.860
Where you're waiting

01:06.860 --> 01:09.860
You'll worship the cruel Dark Queen

01:09.870 --> 01:13.030
Who's drunk with danger

01:13.040 --> 01:16.000
You shattered the glass sword

01:16.000 --> 01:18.970
You wielded without thinking

01:18.970 --> 01:21.910
Its shards glow in the night

01:21.910 --> 01:25.380
I lick your wounded fingers

01:54.680 --> 01:56.550
Are you all right?

02:00.050 --> 02:01.850
A collar...

02:01.850 --> 02:05.200
Where's your master?

02:10.330 --> 02:12.430
What should I do?

02:12.430 --> 02:15.700
I can't just leave it here.

02:17.230 --> 02:21.180
There, there, hold on for just a little bit.

02:35.150 --> 02:36.960
I'm back!

02:43.830 --> 02:48.270
Hime! I..I'm back, Hime...

02:52.070 --> 02:54.880
What's up with Hiro?

02:55.570 --> 02:57.210
Huga.

02:59.370 --> 03:01.380
That was close.

03:01.380 --> 03:03.480
If Hime were to find out...

03:05.210 --> 03:08.890
A cat? Throw it out.

03:10.750 --> 03:13.630
She'd probably say something like that.

03:30.770 --> 03:32.670
And Liza would be like...

03:32.670 --> 03:35.810
I can't live under the same roof as a cat!

03:35.810 --> 03:37.620
Kick it out!

03:40.180 --> 03:44.130
I can't let those two find out.

03:47.160 --> 03:48.830
Sis!

03:50.060 --> 03:52.100
Welcome home, Hiro.

03:52.790 --> 03:55.330
My, what an adorable cat.

04:05.240 --> 04:08.450
I bet your owner is worried sick about you.

04:09.380 --> 04:11.880
Is your leg broken?

04:11.880 --> 04:13.690
Here, Hiro.

04:14.120 --> 04:15.930
I brought him some milk.

04:19.820 --> 04:22.620
He seems pretty weak.

04:22.620 --> 04:25.860
Come on, you won't get better if you don't eat.

04:25.860 --> 04:27.230
What should we do?

04:27.230 --> 04:29.470
That's a good question...

04:30.100 --> 04:34.570
You can soak a washcloth with milk
and feed it that way.

04:34.570 --> 04:36.240
A washcloth?

04:39.210 --> 04:43.110
He's drinking it! Thank you, Sis.

04:43.110 --> 04:47.580
I used to feed you like this when
you weren't feeling well, too.

04:47.580 --> 04:50.790
What am I, a cat now?

04:50.790 --> 04:54.860
Come to think of it, he looks just like
you did when you were a baby.

04:55.320 --> 04:59.400
Look, those eyes and those whiskers...

05:00.730 --> 05:03.300
Oh, it's a girl!

05:03.300 --> 05:06.570
Then, let's call her Hiroko.

05:06.570 --> 05:08.140
Hiroko?!

05:08.140 --> 05:11.740
I always wanted a cute little sister.

05:13.410 --> 05:18.050
Hurry and get better, Hiroko.

05:19.780 --> 05:22.060
Hiroko, huh?

05:53.980 --> 05:55.620
Hiroko!

06:03.290 --> 06:06.030
Good morning, Hiro.

06:06.030 --> 06:08.340
Oh, is that your friend?

06:19.910 --> 06:21.890
She's wearing the same collar.

06:24.510 --> 06:25.910
Hiroko?!

06:25.910 --> 06:28.380
Oh, it is Hiroko!

06:28.380 --> 06:31.890
Good morning, I'm glad you feel better.

06:32.750 --> 06:34.720
You must be hungry.

06:34.720 --> 06:37.640
Okay, I'll go make you some breakfast.

06:39.530 --> 06:45.440
Is this girl from the same world as Hime and Liza?

06:54.240 --> 06:56.310
Here's your breakfast, Hiroko.

06:56.310 --> 06:59.320
Dried bonito! Thank you!

07:00.250 --> 07:07.260
So, you don't remember who put that
collar on you, or where you live?

07:14.300 --> 07:17.040
Here's your breakfast, Hiro.

07:26.370 --> 07:30.110
You can stay here until we find out
where your home is.

07:30.110 --> 07:33.310
I'm sure the Mistress will let you stay.

07:33.320 --> 07:35.660
The Mistress?

07:36.250 --> 07:38.860
Umm, Sis...

07:39.850 --> 07:42.690
She's the mistress of this mansion.

07:42.690 --> 07:44.930
She's really really nice.

07:44.930 --> 07:46.670
Isn't that right, Hiro?

07:47.330 --> 07:49.330
Is she?

07:51.830 --> 07:53.870
Ah, I'm starving.

07:53.870 --> 07:56.910
Sawawa, get me some breakfast! Breakfast!

08:02.780 --> 08:06.350
What the hell is someone from
the Cat Race doing here?

08:06.850 --> 08:08.720
Good morning, Liza.

08:08.720 --> 08:11.100
I'll prepare your breakfast right away.

08:11.520 --> 08:14.360
Liza, there's a good reason for this.

08:14.360 --> 08:16.320
I could care less about your reasons!

08:16.320 --> 08:19.830
Our people have never gotten along with
the Cat Race since time immemorial!

08:19.830 --> 08:21.540
Kick her out right this instant!

08:23.430 --> 08:25.730
It will be all right.

08:25.730 --> 08:30.730
Look, Liza, she doesn't know where her home is.

08:30.970 --> 08:33.370
Like I give a damn!

08:33.380 --> 08:37.440
She has no place to go.
I'd feel terrible kicking her out.

08:37.450 --> 08:41.880
Please just let her stay here until
we find a place for her to go.

08:41.880 --> 08:44.820
Geez, you're such a softie.

08:44.820 --> 08:46.090
Fine, do whatever you want.

08:46.090 --> 08:50.040
But keep her the hell away from me!

08:53.900 --> 08:56.630
Now, where's my food, Sawawa?

08:56.630 --> 08:59.440
Yes, yes, sorry to keep you waiting.

09:16.580 --> 09:19.900
Understood, I shall allow her
to remain in the mansion.

09:20.360 --> 09:23.460
Thank you so much, Mistress.

09:24.430 --> 09:25.930
What do we say, Hiroko?

09:25.930 --> 09:27.910
Thank you very much.

09:29.460 --> 09:31.370
What is it, Hiro?

09:31.370 --> 09:32.530
Huga?

09:32.530 --> 09:38.950
I just assumed, since it's you,
that you'd tell her to get the hell out.

09:41.940 --> 09:46.520
Hiro, just what kind of person do you think I am?

09:47.220 --> 09:50.850
I am merciful.

09:50.850 --> 09:52.560
Huga.

09:54.890 --> 09:56.530
Sorry.

10:00.860 --> 10:05.860
I never knew when I'd have a little sister,
so I prepared lots of things.

10:06.230 --> 10:07.500
Lots of things?

10:07.500 --> 10:09.610
Yep, lots of things.

10:21.780 --> 10:23.420
I'm taking off.

10:23.420 --> 10:25.230
Take care.

10:25.590 --> 10:27.400
Come here, Hiroko.

10:32.830 --> 10:36.600
L..it looks great on you, really.

10:39.430 --> 10:42.880
Take care, Big Brother Hiro.

10:43.770 --> 10:46.150
Big Brother?

10:46.210 --> 10:48.210
Heartwarming Feeling

10:49.110 --> 10:52.150
Okay, I'll be back.

10:57.990 --> 11:00.660
Watch where you're going, Hiro.

11:03.630 --> 11:06.930
Is there anything I can help with,
Big Sister Sawawa?

11:06.930 --> 11:09.460
It's okay, Hiroko, you can just go play.

11:09.460 --> 11:11.880
The weather's really nice outside.

11:38.590 --> 11:41.800
I wonder where Hiroko's playing?

11:55.410 --> 11:59.880
You were playing for quite a while,
so let's get you into a change of clothes.

12:02.020 --> 12:04.930
I wonder what sons of games you were playing?

12:06.790 --> 12:08.770
Let's go with this!

12:14.300 --> 12:15.900
What's that?

12:15.900 --> 12:17.030
Huga.

12:17.030 --> 12:19.670
I can tell that it's dried bonito, silly.

12:19.670 --> 12:22.200
I'm asking what dried bonito
is doing on the floor.

12:25.740 --> 12:27.740
Flandre...

12:27.740 --> 12:29.380
Huga.

12:32.980 --> 12:34.620
Huga?

12:37.320 --> 12:39.700
It looks great.

12:47.600 --> 12:50.300
Oh, dear, I wonder if it was rusted?

12:50.300 --> 12:51.770
How dangerous.

12:51.770 --> 12:54.940
Can you clean that up, Flan?

12:54.940 --> 12:56.570
Huga.

13:00.270 --> 13:02.080
Thank you, Flan.

13:02.810 --> 13:04.950
A trap set by an assassin?

13:04.950 --> 13:10.590
No, I doubt anyone would lay such an idiotic trap.

13:16.460 --> 13:19.060
I guess that's everything
my sister wanted me to buy.

13:20.730 --> 13:21.870
Oh, that's right.

13:26.000 --> 13:28.880
What timing, Hiro!

13:29.800 --> 13:31.810
Princess Sherwood!

13:32.870 --> 13:35.010
Rejoice, Hiro.

13:35.010 --> 13:38.220
I will allow you to help carry my bags.

13:38.980 --> 13:41.480
I was actually just on my way home.

13:41.480 --> 13:45.450
What? Do you object to carrying my bags?

13:45.450 --> 13:46.450
Huga.

13:46.450 --> 13:50.730
No, I'm grateful you're allowing me to carry them.

14:05.770 --> 14:08.410
Yes, yes, just like that.

14:08.410 --> 14:11.050
You learn so quickly, Hiroko.

14:19.050 --> 14:20.690
Mistress...

14:22.960 --> 14:24.990
Have some tea.

14:37.140 --> 14:39.710
You didn't brew this tea, did you, Sawawa?

14:40.940 --> 14:43.580
Hiroko brewed it.

14:45.180 --> 14:48.720
Well, no one makes it like Sawawa,

14:48.720 --> 14:50.560
but it's not bad.

14:53.720 --> 14:55.560
I'll do it!

15:00.830 --> 15:03.030
Why did you buy so much stuff?

15:03.030 --> 15:05.130
Remember this, Hiro.

15:05.130 --> 15:08.700
It takes lots of items for one to be a proper lady.

15:08.700 --> 15:09.770
A lady?

15:09.770 --> 15:10.600
What was that?

15:11.770 --> 15:13.410
Huga.

15:19.580 --> 15:21.560
Francesca?

15:29.290 --> 15:31.320
Oh? An assassin?

15:42.470 --> 15:45.940
Can you bring me the dustpan, Hiroko?

15:52.650 --> 15:54.150
There, there.

15:54.150 --> 15:57.450
Pain, pain go away'!

15:57.450 --> 16:00.990
She's from the Cat Race and she
can't even land on her feet.

16:00.990 --> 16:03.460
What a slow kid.

16:03.460 --> 16:06.960
By the way, what's a rope doing there?

16:07.200 --> 16:11.200
It was so stupid that I didn't think
someone would really do it,

16:11.200 --> 16:14.980
but it seems an assassin
has infiltrated the mansion.

16:15.600 --> 16:17.480
What?!

16:18.170 --> 16:20.040
Assassin?

16:20.040 --> 16:24.990
It means there's somebody here
who wants to kill me.

16:27.520 --> 16:29.550
Pretty weak, huh?

16:30.120 --> 16:33.690
Is this guy really an assassin?

16:33.690 --> 16:35.330
Huga.

16:36.090 --> 16:37.730
Huh?

16:38.360 --> 16:40.170
That collar...

16:43.400 --> 16:44.900
What's wrong, Hiro?

16:44.900 --> 16:48.310
Does that mean that Hiroko's an assassin?!

16:49.100 --> 16:51.270
What's the matter with Hiro?

16:51.270 --> 16:52.870
Huga.

16:52.870 --> 16:57.080
We searched the entire mansion to no avail.

16:57.080 --> 16:59.950
There aren't any signs of a break-in either.

16:59.950 --> 17:04.650
But there is definitely someone here
who is trying to kill me.

17:04.650 --> 17:06.330
Hime!

17:11.660 --> 17:13.590
See what I mean?

17:13.590 --> 17:15.060
I see.

17:15.060 --> 17:16.430
Hiro!

17:16.430 --> 17:19.210
Big Brother Hiro!

17:24.340 --> 17:29.140
Oh, dear, was the chandelier rusted, too?

17:29.140 --> 17:30.950
There you go.

17:42.190 --> 17:45.230
Setting up another lame trap, are we?

17:45.830 --> 17:52.750
Do you lay traps because you lack the physical
strength to fight me man-to-man?

17:56.270 --> 18:01.270
Whoever you are, I won't hold back
if you're trying to kill me.

18:01.340 --> 18:02.780
Prepare to die!

18:02.780 --> 18:06.150
So, cats can't be trusted after all!

18:06.150 --> 18:07.910
I'll skin you to make a shamisen!

18:07.920 --> 18:09.550
Huga.

18:15.820 --> 18:18.240
Hime! Hiroko!

18:29.270 --> 18:31.080
She's so weak.

18:35.010 --> 18:36.580
What should we do, Hime?

18:36.580 --> 18:38.710
I will kill her in one blow.

18:38.710 --> 18:40.890
The least we can do is let her die painlessly.

18:56.030 --> 18:58.410
Hiro! What's gotten into you?!

18:59.870 --> 19:03.640
Please don't kill her, Hime.

19:03.640 --> 19:07.050
I'll have you know she's trying to kill me!

19:08.380 --> 19:10.280
But still...

19:10.280 --> 19:12.350
Out of my way, Hiro!

19:12.350 --> 19:14.650
Hime!

19:14.650 --> 19:17.920
That girl is being manipulated.

19:17.920 --> 19:19.590
Reiri...

19:19.590 --> 19:20.920
You!

19:20.920 --> 19:22.990
She's being manipulated?

19:22.990 --> 19:26.270
Take her collar off and see for yourself, Hiro.

19:26.490 --> 19:28.470
Her collar?

19:52.990 --> 19:55.490
Big Brother Hiro!

19:57.020 --> 19:59.400
What's going on?

20:03.630 --> 20:05.270
Huga.

20:05.430 --> 20:10.430
The bell on her collar was telling her
to kill the Royal Family.

20:10.670 --> 20:13.910
They'd use that on such a weakling?

20:15.140 --> 20:17.880
Maybe they were going for quantity over quality.

20:18.510 --> 20:23.510
Mistress, there are five more of those children
who are being used as assassins.

20:25.220 --> 20:26.860
What?!

20:27.250 --> 20:31.660
They'll do whatever it takes to win this fight.

20:31.660 --> 20:34.470
I don't like this at all.

20:35.130 --> 20:38.430
Is the royal throne really so magnificent

20:38.430 --> 20:41.900
that they'd resort to such measures to win it?

20:47.810 --> 20:51.350
Big Brother Hiro! Big Brother Hiro!

20:53.810 --> 20:57.280
Geez, all to save an assassin's life.

20:57.280 --> 20:59.320
You're such a softie.

21:01.160 --> 21:04.990
After learning that she was being
used as an assassin,

21:04.990 --> 21:08.910
she was so shocked that she ran away.

21:09.700 --> 21:14.150
I will never see Hiroko ever again.

21:22.480 --> 21:26.910
What should I have Hiroko wear
the next time she comes over?

21:26.910 --> 21:28.890
There's too many to choose from!

21:36.720 --> 21:39.070
Today's another nice day.

21:40.360 --> 21:41.730
I'm taking off!

21:41.730 --> 21:45.400
Take care, Big Brother Hiro!

21:49.840 --> 21:54.510
I'm going to pray that, one day,

21:54.580 --> 21:59.580
Hiroko meets a master who puts a collar on her,
not to use her as an assassin,

22:00.880 --> 22:04.420
but because he genuinely cares for her.

22:13.060 --> 22:18.060
Get down on your knees and lick my red nails

22:18.630 --> 22:26.570
Call me queen with your entangled tongue

22:29.140 --> 22:31.910
The sun that blooms in Hell

22:31.910 --> 22:34.650
Darkness that's fallen to Paradise

22:34.650 --> 22:37.220
If you're confronted with light and despair

22:37.220 --> 22:39.850
Which one goes deeper?

22:39.850 --> 22:42.590
Roses fly from my head

22:42.590 --> 22:45.290
I'll scatter them into Nirvana

22:45.290 --> 22:47.890
Wounds that secretly pain you

22:47.900 --> 22:50.470
Blood that gushes away

22:50.530 --> 22:53.170
They both lead to the depths of my heart

22:53.170 --> 22:55.840
You've given these gorgeous gifts as tribute

22:55.840 --> 22:58.510
And yet you're still

22:58.510 --> 23:01.210
Seeking love?

23:01.210 --> 23:03.940
Tell me exactly to what extent

23:03.940 --> 23:06.610
Grown men are just foolish little boys?

23:06.610 --> 23:11.610
Get down on your knees and lick my sacred feet

23:11.890 --> 23:16.890
Call me queen in your hoarse voice

23:17.320 --> 23:22.320
The proof of your life creeps up the tower of pain

23:22.560 --> 23:25.270
Slowly making your way, you can barely breathe

23:25.270 --> 23:27.900
But if you still ask for it

23:27.900 --> 23:31.870
Your dying breath just might be

23:31.870 --> 23:40.160
The words that melt my frozen tears

23:41.480 --> 23:42.650
Huga.

23:42.650 --> 23:46.620
Let's see, vitamin A, B, C, D, E, K...

23:46.620 --> 23:48.190
Which one works for colds again?!

23:48.190 --> 23:49.020
Huga?

23:49.020 --> 23:50.090
Eating rice.

23:50.090 --> 23:53.130
No, wait, that's for when you get
a fishbone stuck in your throat.

23:53.130 --> 23:55.260
And snakes come out at night
when you blow a whistle!

23:55.260 --> 23:56.930
Wait, that's got nothing to do with it.

23:56.930 --> 23:59.570
Damn, Hime caught a cold!

23:59.570 --> 24:02.300
What should I do to help her get better?!

24:02.300 --> 24:04.370
Next episode, "Princess Attrition"

24:04.370 --> 24:06.810
I just need to keep warm and get some bed rest.

24:06.810 --> 24:07.840
Huga, huga.

24:08.540 --> 24:10.280
Huga!
